# Design-system sync tooling and its generated bundle.
# `.ds-sync/` is a local authoring helper with its own npm tree, and
# `ds-bundle/` is the artefact it emits. Neither is imported by the app, built
# by vite, or shipped. Both were committed by accident in 0ac3d46 and cost two
# CI gates: oxlint reported 1640 errors in the generated `_ds_bundle.js`, and
# Trivy picked up `.ds-sync/package-lock.json` as a dependency tree AXIAM ships.
.ds-sync/
ds-bundle/
